  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button",
      "description": "Default ruled control for actions.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn\">Copy path</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;min-height:32px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);border-radius:3px;background:var(--stock);color:var(--ink);font:550 14px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms ease-out,border-color 150ms ease-out;} .ds-btn:hover{background:var(--stock-2);border-color:var(--ink-3);} .ds-btn:active{background:var(--rule-soft);} .ds-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "The one main action, such as Re-analyze.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-3-6.7L21 8\"/><path d=\"M21 3v5h-5\"/></svg>Re-analyze</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;min-height:32px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);border-radius:3px;background:var(--stock);color:var(--ink);font:550 14px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms ease-out,border-color 150ms ease-out;background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink);} .ds-btn-primary:hover{border-color:var(--ink);} .ds-btn-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ghost Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-ghost",
      "description": "Low-emphasis action inside cards (close, copy).",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-ghost\">Close</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-ghost{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;min-height:32px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);border-radius:3px;background:var(--stock);color:var(--ink);font:550 14px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms ease-out,border-color 150ms ease-out;min-height:26px;padding:0 8px;font-size:13px;background:transparent;border-color:transparent;} .ds-btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--stock-2);border-color:var(--rule);} .ds-btn-ghost:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Search Input",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Ruled field with a leading icon.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-search\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"/><path d=\"m20 20-3.5-3.5\"/></svg><input type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Find a module\" aria-label=\"Find a module\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-search{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;max-width:320px;} .ds-search svg{position:absolute;left:9px;color:var(--ink-3);pointer-events:none;} .ds-search input{width:100%;min-height:32px;padding:0 8px 0 30px;border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);border-radius:3px;background:var(--stock);color:var(--ink);font:14px system-ui,sans-serif;} .ds-search input::placeholder{color:var(--ink-3);} .ds-search input:hover{border-color:var(--ink-3);} .ds-search input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Drawer Rail Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-item",
      "description": "Oak rail; the active item is the open drawer, not red.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-rail\"><div class=\"ds-brand\"><span class=\"ds-mark\"></span>DepTrace</div><a href=\"#\" aria-current=\"page\">Overview</a><a href=\"#\">Modules</a><a href=\"#\">Graph</a><a href=\"#\">Violations</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-rail{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;width:216px;padding:14px 0 12px;background:var(--rail);color:var(--rail-ink);font:14px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif;} .ds-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:2px 18px 18px;font:650 17px/1 system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.01em;} .ds-mark{width:22px;height:16px;background:var(--stock);border-radius:2px;box-shadow:inset 0 -5px 0 -4px var(--rule-strong);} .ds-rail a{margin:0 8px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:3px;color:var(--rail-ink);text-decoration:none;transition:background-color 150ms ease-out;} .ds-rail a:hover{background:var(--rail-2);} .ds-rail a[aria-current=page]{background:var(--rail-2);font-weight:600;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--rail-ink-2);} .ds-rail a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--rail-ink);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Severity and Baseline Badges",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "badge-error",
      "description": "Status always carries an icon and a label.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-badge ds-err\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 8v4M12 16h.01\"/></svg>error</span> <span class=\"ds-badge ds-warn\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20L12 3Z\"/><path d=\"M12 10v4M12 18h.01\"/></svg>warning</span> <span class=\"ds-badge ds-new\">new</span> <span class=\"ds-badge ds-existing\">existing</span> <span class=\"ds-badge\">layer: domain</span>",
      "css": ".ds-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:0 7px;min-height:21px;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:3px;background:var(--stock-2);color:var(--ink-2);font:12px system-ui,sans-serif;white-space:nowrap;} .ds-badge svg{width:13px;height:13px;} .ds-err{border-color:var(--critical);background:var(--critical-wash);color:var(--critical-ink);font-weight:600;} .ds-warn{border-color:var(--warning);background:var(--warning-wash);color:var(--warning-ink);font-weight:600;} .ds-new{border-color:var(--ink);background:var(--ink);color:var(--stock);font-weight:600;} .ds-existing{border-style:dashed;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Catalog Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "catalog-card",
      "description": "The pulled card: call-number path, index-red header rule, cross-reference sections.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><header class=\"ds-card-head\"><h2 class=\"ds-call\"><span class=\"ds-dir\">src/domain/<wbr></span>pricing.ts</h2><div class=\"ds-meta\"><span class=\"ds-tag\"><span class=\"ds-swatch\"></span>domain</span></div></header><section class=\"ds-sec\"><h3>Imports <span class=\"ds-count\">2</span></h3><ul><li><a href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-dir\">src/domain/<wbr></span>money.ts</a><span class=\"ds-ref\">3:1</span></li><li><a href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-dir\">src/shared/<wbr></span>round.ts</a><span class=\"ds-ref\">4:1 type</span></li></ul></section><section class=\"ds-sec\"><h3>Imported by <span class=\"ds-count\">1</span></h3><ul><li><a href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-dir\">src/application/<wbr></span>cart-service.ts</a><span class=\"ds-ref\">7:1</span></li></ul></section></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{max-width:400px;background:var(--stock);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:2px;color:var(--ink);font:14px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif;} .ds-card-head{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:14px 16px 12px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--index-red);} .ds-call{margin:0;font:650 15px/1.25 ui-monospace,Consolas,monospace;} .ds-dir{color:var(--ink-3);} a:hover .ds-dir{color:inherit;} .ds-tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:0 7px;min-height:21px;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:3px;background:var(--stock-2);font-size:12px;color:var(--ink);} .ds-swatch{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--graph-node-ring);background:var(--layer-1);} .ds-sec{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule-soft);} .ds-sec:last-child{border-bottom:0;} .ds-sec h3{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:0;font-size:12px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-2);} .ds-count{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0;padding:0 6px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--stock-2);border:1px solid var(--rule);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;} .ds-sec ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;} .ds-sec li{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;gap:4px 8px;padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule-soft);} .ds-sec li:last-child{border-bottom:0;} .ds-sec a{font:13px ui-monospace,Consolas,monospace;color:var(--accent);text-underline-offset:2px;} .ds-sec a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px;} .ds-ref{margin-left:auto;font:12px ui-monospace,Consolas,monospace;color:var(--ink-3);}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Summary Ledger",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "Ruled ledger of real counts, in place of KPI tiles.",
      "html": "<dl class=\"ds-ledger\"><div><dt>Modules</dt><dd class=\"ds-val\">412</dd><dd class=\"ds-det\">source files analysed</dd></div><div><dt>Cycles</dt><dd class=\"ds-val\">3</dd><dd class=\"ds-det\">strongly connected groups</dd></div></dl>",
      "css": ".ds-ledger{margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));background:var(--stock);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:3px;color:var(--ink);font:14px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif;} .ds-ledger div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(140px,1fr) auto;grid-template-areas:\"l v\" \"d d\";column-gap:12px;padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule-soft);} .ds-ledger dt{grid-area:l;font-weight:600;} .ds-val{grid-area:v;margin:0;font-size:18px;font-weight:650;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;text-align:right;} .ds-det{grid-area:d;margin:0;color:var(--ink-3);font-size:13px;}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Card Catalog",
    "overview": "Every module is a catalog card. The dashboard is a card catalog of the codebase: a file path is a call number, its imports and importers are cross-references, and selecting anything pulls its card. White ruled index stock sits on a pale ruling-blue ground, the shell is an oak drawer rail, and one index-card red rule marks the card that has been pulled. Everything structural is drawn the way a library card is printed: with thin blue ruling, never with depth.\n\nDensity is that of a working tool used next to the editor: 14px body, 32px controls, tables and ruled lists rather than tiles. Colour is reserved for meaning. The oak rail and the red rule are the only material colours; blue is the interaction accent; layer hues, status hues and the cycle magenta each encode one thing in data and never decorate. The world refuses the category default of a dark KPI-tile wall with a glowing graph.\n\nBoth themes are first-class. The light theme is the catalog in daylight; the dark theme keeps the same structure with a darker oak and ruling, and follows the OS unless the reader picks Light or Dark in the rail.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Hairline structure: 1px ruling carries every boundary, no shadows anywhere.",
      "An oak drawer rail as the shell; the open drawer is a lighter face with a hairline label holder.",
      "One red rule, on the pulled catalog card's header only.",
      "Paths lettered as call numbers: folder recedes, file name reads first, breaks only after \"/\".",
      "Monospace only for literal identifiers the CLI prints; everything else is system sans.",
      "Data colour is categorical, validated and never cycled."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Red Rule",
        "body": "`index-red` appears only as the 2px rule on the header of a pulled catalog card. The active nav item is the open-drawer face (`rail-2` plus a 1px inset `rail-ink-2` hairline), never red.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Never-Cycled Rule",
